{"seq":2,"slug":"daily-care-and-rehabilitation","title":"日常照护与康复","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/daily-care-and-rehabilitation","wordCount":1222,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"日常照护与康复\">日常照护与康复</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>我第一次跟着护理员给一位卧床老人翻身，才真正理解什么叫&quot;专业照护&quot;。看着简单的一个动作，背后藏着力学、皮肤保护和沟通的全部讲究——翻早了打扰休息，翻晚了可能压出褥疮，用力不对还会扭伤老人或自己。日常照护从来不是&quot;伺候人&quot;那么简单，它是一门有标准、有方法的技术活。</p>\n<p>这一节抓住这些：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>失能评估先行</strong>：照护不是凭感觉，先评估能力等级，再定照护计划。</li>\n<li><strong>基础照护项目</strong>：进食、清洁、翻身、转移、排泄护理，每一项都有规范。</li>\n<li><strong>褥疮（压力性损伤）预防</strong>：卧床老人的头号风险，靠定时翻身和减压。</li>\n<li><strong>康复的目标</strong>：不是&quot;治好&quot;，而是尽量恢复或维持功能，延缓失能进程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"先评估-再照护\">先评估，再照护</h3><p>照护一个老人之前，先要回答&quot;他能做什么、不能做什么&quot;。这就要用到失能评估。前面提过国家把失能分为轻、中、重三级，评估时常看六项日常活动（进食、洗澡、穿衣、如厕、移动、控便）。我们可以用一个简单的打分思路来理解：每项按&quot;完全自理 / 需协助 / 完全依赖&quot;打 2/1/0 分，总分越低失能越重。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>自理得分</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{自理得分} = \\sum_{i=1}^{6} s_i, \\quad s_i \\in \\{0, 1, 2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自理得分</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>满分 12 分代表完全自理，得分越接近 0 越接近重度失能。评估结果直接决定护理员配比、照护频次和是否需要医养结合介入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础照护项目与规范\">基础照护项目与规范</h3><p>下面是几项核心照护和它们的关键要点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>照护项目</th>\n<th>关键要点</th>\n<th>常见风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协助进食</td>\n<td>小口、慢喂、坐起</td>\n<td>误吸、呛咳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清洁/助浴</td>\n<td>控温、防滑、保暖</td>\n<td>跌倒、着凉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>翻身</td>\n<td>定时、轴线翻身</td>\n<td>褥疮、扭伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转移</td>\n<td>借力、护腰</td>\n<td>跌倒、拉伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排泄护理</td>\n<td>及时、保护隐私</td>\n<td>感染、尊严受损</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>我想特别强调&quot;误吸&quot;这个风险。给吞咽困难的老人喂饭，如果让他平躺着大口吃，食物可能呛进气管引发肺炎，这是卧床老人致命的常见原因之一。所以&quot;坐起来、小口喂&quot;不是讲究，是救命。</p>\n<h3 id=\"褥疮预防-和时间赛跑\">褥疮预防：和时间赛跑</h3><p>卧床老人长时间压着同一块皮肤，局部血液不通，就会烂出褥疮（医学上叫压力性损伤）。预防的核心就一个字：动。行业里有个经验法则——每两小时翻身一次。我们可以把一天需要的翻身次数算出来：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>每日翻身次数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn><mtext> 小时</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> 小时/次</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mtext> 次</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{每日翻身次数} = \\frac{24 \\ \\text{小时}}{2 \\ \\text{小时/次}} = 12 \\ \\text{次}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每日翻身次数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小时</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小时</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，照护一位完全卧床的老人，光翻身这一项，一天就要 12 次，昼夜不停。这也解释了为什么重度失能照护那么耗人力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"康复-维持比恢复更现实\">康复：维持比恢复更现实</h3><p>很多人对老年康复有误解，以为是要&quot;练回年轻时的状态&quot;。其实老年康复更现实的目标是维持现有功能、延缓退化。比如脑卒中后的肢体训练、防跌倒的平衡练习、维持关节活动度的被动运动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[失能评估] --&gt; B[制定照护计划]&#10;    B --&gt; C[基础照护:进食/清洁/翻身]&#10;    B --&gt; D[康复训练:平衡/肌力/关节]&#10;    C --&gt; E[定期复评]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt;|功能变化| B\">flowchart LR\n    A[失能评估] --&gt; B[制定照护计划]\n    B --&gt; C[基础照护:进食/清洁/翻身]\n    B --&gt; D[康复训练:平衡/肌力/关节]\n    C --&gt; E[定期复评]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt;|功能变化| B</pre><p>照护和康复是一对搭档：照护守住下限，不让情况恶化；康复争取上限，尽量让老人多保留一点自主生活的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用本节的&quot;自理得分&quot;思路给一位虚拟老人打分（六项各打 0/1/2），算出总分并判断失能等级倾向。</li>\n<li>一位完全卧床的老人，按每 2 小时翻身一次，一个白班（8 小时）需要翻身几次？</li>\n<li>为什么给吞咽困难的老人喂饭一定要先让他坐起来？解释误吸的风险。</li>\n<li>&quot;照护守下限、康复争上限&quot;这句话，你怎么理解？举一个具体例子。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《养老护理员国家职业技能标准》详细规定了各项照护操作的规范，是从业者必读。</li>\n<li>找一段正规的翻身、转移操作教学视频，对照本节看动作要领。</li>\n<li>老年康复相关的科普读物，能帮你建立&quot;维持功能&quot;而非&quot;治愈&quot;的正确期待。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们把日常照护拆成了&quot;评估—照护—康复&quot;的专业流程，理解了翻身、喂饭这些动作背后的技术和风险。但有一类老人，他们的身体也许还能动，难题却在大脑——认知症老人需要的是完全不同的照护逻辑。下一节我们就专门来谈认知症与心理照护。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"日常照护与康复","id":"日常照护与康复"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"先评估，再照护","id":"先评估-再照护"},{"level":3,"text":"基础照护项目与规范","id":"基础照护项目与规范"},{"level":3,"text":"褥疮预防：和时间赛跑","id":"褥疮预防-和时间赛跑"},{"level":3,"text":"康复：维持比恢复更现实","id":"康复-维持比恢复更现实"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"慢性病与健康监测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/chronic-disease-and-health-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"认知症与心理照护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/dementia-and-mental-health-care"}}